<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA APERTURA RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA APERTURA RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Wednesday's</p>
<p>matches in the Argentine Apertura soccer championship:</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy    0   Rosario Central    0</p>
<p> Independiente     4   Newell's Old Boys  0</p>
<p> Platense	    2   Estudiantes	  4</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield   2   Racing Club	  3</p>
<p> Union		 1   River Plate	  3</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Independiente	     2  2  0  0  7  0  6</p>
<p> River Plate		 2  1  1  0  3  1  4</p>
<p> Rosario Central	   2  1  1  0  2  0  4</p>
<p> Colon			 2  1  1  0  4  3  4</p>
<p> Banfield		    2  1  1  0  2  1  4</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	    2  1  1  0  1  0  4</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	 2  1  1  0  1  0  4</p>
<p> Union			 2  1  0  1  7  6  3</p>
<p> Estudiantes		 2  1  0  1  6  5  3</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	   2  1  0  1  4  3  3</p>
<p> Lanus			 2  1  1  0  1  0  3</p>
<p> Boca Juniors		2  1  0  1  5  5  3</p>
<p> Racing Club		 2  1  0  1  3  4  3</p>
<p> Huracan		     2  0  2  0  1  1  1</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	 2  0  1  1  1  2  1</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		 2  0  1  1  1  2  1</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes	2  0  1  1  4  7  1</p>
<p> Platense		    2  0  0  2  2  5  0</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste	2  0  0  2  0  4  0</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	 2  0  0  2  0  6  0</p>
<p>Note: the Apertura championship is the first of two</p>
<p>tournaments played in the Argentine season which runs from</p>
<p>August to July. The teams play each other once in each</p>
<p>competition and there is no overall champion.</p>
